    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "The Timeline answers what couples actually ask. Traditional Ceremony expands into its run of show — processional, cocktail hour, reception doors — tied to the venue and time already planned. Payments sits in the same portal: the package and its schedule, connected to the record they share with their planner.",
